{"words": [{"text": "۞ تِلْكَ", "translation": "These"}, {"text": "ٱلرُّسُلُ", "translation": "(are) the Messengers"}, {"text": "فَضَّلْنَا", "translation": "We (have) preferred"}, {"text": "بَعْضَهُمْ", "translation": "some of them"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "over"}, {"text": "بَعْضٍۢ ۘ", "translation": "others"}, {"text": "مِّنْهُم", "translation": "Among them"}, {"text": "مَّن", "translation": "(were those with) whom"}, {"text": "كَلَّمَ", "translation": "spoke"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ ۖ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "وَرَفَعَ", "translation": "and He raised"}, {"text": "بَعْضَهُمْ", "translation": "some of them"}, {"text": "دَرَجَـٰتٍۢ ۚ", "translation": "(in) degrees"}, {"text": "وَءَاتَيْنَا", "translation": "And We gave"}, {"text": "عِيسَى", "translation": "Isa"}, {"text": "ٱبْنَ", "translation": "son"}, {"text": "مَرْيَمَ", "translation": "(of) Maryam"}, {"text": "ٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ", "translation": "the clear proofs"}, {"text": "وَأَيَّدْنَـٰهُ", "translation": "and We supported him"}, {"text": "بِرُوحِ", "translation": "with Spirit"}, {"text": "ٱلْقُدُسِ ۗ", "translation": "[the] Holy"}, {"text": "وَلَوْ", "translation": "And if"}, {"text": "شَآءَ", "translation": "(had) willed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "not"}, {"text": "ٱقْتَتَلَ", "translation": "(would have) fought each other"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "مِنۢ", "translation": "(came) from"}, {"text": "بَعْدِهِم", "translation": "after them"}, {"text": "مِّنۢ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "بَعْدِ", "translation": "after"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "[what]"}, {"text": "جَآءَتْهُمُ", "translation": "came to them"}, {"text": "ٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتُ", "translation": "the clear proofs"}, {"text": "وَلَـٰكِنِ", "translation": "[And] but"}, {"text": "ٱخْتَلَفُوا۟", "translation": "they differed"}, {"text": "فَمِنْهُم", "translation": "[so] of them"}, {"text": "مَّنْ", "translation": "(are some) who"}, {"text": "ءَامَنَ", "translation": "believed"}, {"text": "وَمِنْهُم", "translation": "and of them"}, {"text": "مَّن", "translation": "(are some) who"}, {"text": "كَفَرَ ۚ", "translation": "denied"}, {"text": "وَلَوْ", "translation": "And if"}, {"text": "شَآءَ", "translation": "(had) willed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "not"}, {"text": "ٱقْتَتَلُوا۟", "translation": "they (would have) fought each other"}, {"text": "وَلَـٰكِنَّ", "translation": "[and] but"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "يَفْعَلُ", "translation": "does"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "يُرِيدُ", "translation": "He intends"}], "sahih": "Those messengers - some of them We caused to exceed others. Among them were those to whom Allāh spoke, and He raised some of them in degree. And We gave Jesus, the son of Mary, clear proofs, and We supported him with the Pure Spirit [i.e., Gabriel]. If Allāh had willed, those [generations] succeeding them would not have fought each other after the clear proofs had come to them. But they differed, and some of them believed and some of them disbelieved. And if Allāh had willed, they would not have fought each other, but Allāh does what He intends."}